  "solution": {
    "text": "Let,&nbsp;<math><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></math> and <math><mi>w</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></msup></math> <math><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math><msup><mrow><mi>z</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>w</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cos</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">sin</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>&#960;</mi></math><br />For <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;we have&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pairs</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo></math> we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pairs</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br />For <math><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we have <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pairs</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>of</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>",
